+## 评分函数
+
+### Negatives (negatives.ts)
+
+```typescript
+type NegativeScoringFunction = (ctx: ScoringContext) => number;
+
+// 免疫检查
+checkTypeImmunity(ctx): number;           // -100
+checkAbilityTypeImmunity(ctx): number;    // -20
+checkItemTypeImmunity(ctx): number;       // -20 (Air Balloon)
