+/**
+ * Check if move will hit partner as spread damage
+ * Spread moves (Earthquake, Surf, etc.) with target 'allAdjacent' hit partner
+ *
+ * Penalty scales with actual damage to partner (v1.1.20):
+ * - Can KO partner: -25
+ * - > 50% HP damage: -15
+ * - > 25% HP damage: -10
+ * - Low damage: -5
